  "remaining_boundary": "One genuine dense closable compact-gradient G, one bounded actual conditional mean T and one bounded vector-L2 gradient K are chosen before all rough L2(ν) inputs. (Tu,Ku) lies in the actual closed compact-gradient graph; the sharp c=(1−αη)²/[4(1+αη)] norm defect and source4η bound hold. Original C2/two Hessian bounds/positive capped step retained. Finite Hilbert/Borel/rank0 explicitly extends source Euclidean setting. Every-y literal kernel law is distinct from AE rough mean/fiber L1 and squareL1. Separately defined weak-H1 equivalence, full B13/Gamma/dynamics/main/error/cost/composition remain open.",
